here is the cypher query to answer the question:

```
match (q:question) where q.answered = true return count(q);
```

this query matches all nodes of type `question` where the property `answered` is `true`, and then returns the count of these matched questions. 

if you want the result in a more human-readable format, you can use an alias for the return value:

```cypher
match (q:question) where q.answered = true return count(q) as number_of_answered_questions;
```

you can also add other properties to the return value if needed.

